WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.470
- So, what was your relationship

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:02.710
like with your mom? Like growing up?

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:03.640
Were you one of those kids

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.190
that did slime in the dog's hair?

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.930
- My mom let me do quite a bit of things

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:09.830
but my mom also had a
radical sense of humor.

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:11.700
Like an incredible sense of humor.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.960
Like she, I remember she
knows I love animals.

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:14.920
So when I was in college,

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:17.170
she sent me a box that
had holes punched in it.

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:18.260
She, and in college,

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:19.470
and she said, I found you a pet.

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:20.960
You could, in the mail,

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.210
you could keep in your dorm room.

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:23.760
I hope it survived on the food and water.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:24.949
And it was a dead lizard,

00:00:24.949 --> 00:00:25.782
(audience laugh)

00:00:25.782 --> 00:00:27.010
that she had found in the backyard

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:28.270
and was like this'll be funny

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:29.103
to send to my daughter.

00:00:29.103 --> 00:00:29.936
(audience laughing)

00:00:29.936 --> 00:00:30.769
- What?

00:00:30.769 --> 00:00:31.602
- But she also once bought me

00:00:31.602 --> 00:00:33.040
a taxidermied alligator

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.835
from, like a garage sale

00:00:34.835 --> 00:00:35.668
(audience laughing)

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:37.540
and sent it to me in the mail.

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:38.530
- [Kelly] I love it.

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:40.050
- And she would go around

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:41.350
- This kind of explains how you

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:42.685
found your partner in life as well.

00:00:42.685 --> 00:00:43.518
- A little bit, a little bit.

00:00:43.518 --> 00:00:44.351
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:44.351 --> 00:00:45.800
She would, I got two more zeros for you.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.040
She would go around the neighborhood

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:49.440
and collect cicada
shells, you know, cicadas.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.430
She, but she would put
them in a cookie tin

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:53.180
and then send 'em to me in college

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:54.580
and be like Christmas cookies

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:56.045
but it was just dead cicada shells.

00:00:56.045 --> 00:00:57.100
(audience laughing)

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:57.933
- What?

00:00:57.933 --> 00:00:59.248
- [Guest] And one time
when I was in high school,

00:00:59.248 --> 00:01:00.081
- What?

00:01:00.081 --> 00:01:01.780
- she bribed, she was
a cardiologist nurse,

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:04.200
she bribed like the mortician

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.090
to let her borrow three human hearts

00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:08.990
and brought 'em into my science class.

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:11.330
- Pretty sure that's illegal.

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:12.163
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:12.163 --> 00:01:13.902
Pretty sure that, I dunno.

00:01:13.902 --> 00:01:15.517
- Well, if you can prove it, Kelly

00:01:15.517 --> 00:01:17.390
because I had nothing to do with it.

00:01:17.390 --> 00:01:19.726
- That, your mother is awesome.

00:01:19.726 --> 00:01:20.570
- She's rad.

00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:21.403
- Oh my God.

00:01:21.403 --> 00:01:22.960
- She's got like a dark sense of humor,

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:24.540
which is probably where I get my

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:25.373
dark sense of humor.

00:01:25.373 --> 00:01:26.206
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:26.206 --> 00:01:27.300
And your attraction to it.

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:28.190
- Yeah.

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:29.510
- Oh my God. That's amazing.

00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:31.200
I, I love your mom.

